  "impact": {
    "areas": ["frontend", "api", "authorization", "customer-flow", "analytics"],
    "notes": [
      "Adds a chronological, business-isolated History view over existing Opportunities, Actions, Execution Kits, feedback and Outcomes.",
      "History is implemented as a read-oriented projection over existing authoritative records; no duplicate History table or source of truth is introduced.",
      "The initial API supports status, category, goal and date filtering with Business scoping applied before projection.",
      "History preserves exact Knowledge Pack provenance and produces factual learning summaries without causal claims.",
      "Deterministic filter, limit and safe evidence-category policy tests are included.",
      "PES navigation, routing, authentication, state management and framework structure remain unchanged.",
      "Runtime remains disabled outside development/test; release, deployment and production enablement are not authorized."
    ]
  },
